            "text": "theorem covariance_bounds (B N0 : ℕ) :\n    (∀ i j, MeanClass strip 1 ((seed B N0).covariance i j)) ∧\n      (∀ i j, MeanClass strip (3 / 2 - ChartScales.kappa)\n        ((seed B N0).covariance i j - ActualPrimaryCovariance.tangentCovariance B N0 i j))"
